; FBX 7.4.0 project file
; USDprep test scene, written by hand: frames 1001-1003 at 24 fps.
;   Box    - a quad moving along X, 0 -> 2
;   Bar    - two quads along X skinned to Bone1 (at 0) and Bone2 (at 1);
;            Bone2 turns 90 degrees about Z, so the far end (2,0,0) ends at (1,1,0)
;   Cam    - a camera at (0,0,10) turned to look down -Z, 54.43 degrees wide, 16:9
